{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_34.json","id":74872,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power French Vanilla","brandName":"GNC Pro Performance AMP","brandIpSymbol":"®","upcSku":"0 48107 12570 7","productVersionCode":"CODE 386343 DPG","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"6","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent Daily Values are based on 2,000 calorie diet","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Image difference, same product","labelId":49174},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":27809},{"type":"Package size difference, same product","labelId":49174}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1167,"text":"Distributed by:","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1167,"name":"General Nutrition Corporation","streetAddress":"","city":"Pittsburgh","state":"PA","country":"","zipCode":"15222","phoneNumber":"1-888-462-2548","email":"","webAddress":"gnc.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":18.17,"unit":"oz.","display":"18.17 oz."},{"order":2,"quantity":1.14,"unit":"lb","display":"1.14 lb"},{"order":3,"quantity":516,"unit":"Gram(s)","display":"516 Gram(s)"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":28.6,"maxQuantity":86,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":2,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1-3 scoops","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"7 products in one"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"60g whey isolate & hydrolysates to support muscle recovery & growth"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically proven ingredient deliver more strength & power + testosterone support"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"600mg testofen fenugreek to boost anabolic factors in the body & 3g creatine blend\n18g BCAA to stimulate protein synthesis for improved muscle recovery"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Banned substance free"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Clinically researched"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Natural + artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Code 386343 DPG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: Once per day as a dietary supplement, consume 1-3 scoops of GNC Pro Performance AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power in 4,8 or 12 fl. oz. of cold water respectively, 30 minutes after your workout. On non-training days, consume one serving first thing in the morning. For extreme results, take the full 3 scoop serving twice per day, pre- and post-workout."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Daily dose Protein Power complex Benefit\n1 scoop 30 minutes post-workout or in the morning 20 g 7.19 g Helps meet protein needs & fuels metabolism\n2 scoops 30 minutes post-workout or in the morning 40 g 14.38 g Fuels muscles, metabolism, supports recovery & muscle protein synthesis\n3 scoops 30 minutes post-workout or in the morning 60 g 21.6 g Increase muscle size, anabolic factors, and power & strength by 30%"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Serving per container 18 9 6"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains: Milk and soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains: Milk and soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Warning: For adults use only. Use only as directed."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, under 18 years of age, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Notice: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction. Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"An 8-week study of athletes performing an intense resistance exercise training regimen demonstrated that those using this proprietary module of whey protein and leucine had greater increases in muscle strength and size than those on a placebo."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When used in conjunction with an exercise program. As with any food product, use of this product alone will not lead to increase muscle mass or strength."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Per 3 scoop serving."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Inclusion of these enzymes resulted in a 12% greater protein breakdown as measured by the release profile of the amino acid tyrosine. These results represent the enzyme activity potential under simulated conditions. Effects in the human body have not been studied."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Testofen is a resistered trademark of Gencor."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Aminogen and Carbogen are registered trademarks of Innophos Nutrition, Inc."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CereCalase is a registered trademark of National Enzyme Company, Inc."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Enzyme Matrix is a GNC Trademark."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-Choice.org\nTrusted by sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lab. Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2015 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Daily"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Power\nRecovery\nStrength"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Typial amino acid profile per 3 scoop serving\nAlanine 2913 mg\nArginine 1223 mg\nAspartate 6450 mg\nCystine 1440 mg\nGlutamine & glutamic acid 10310 mg\nGlycine 982 mg\nHistidine 1095 mg\nIsoleucine 4007 mg\nLeucine 10088 mg\nLysine 5194 mg\nMethionine 1218 mg\nPhenylalanine 1799 mg\nProline 4023 mg\nSerine 2809 mg\nThreonine 4179 mg\nTryptophan 1020 mg\nTyrosine 1747 mg\nValine 4003 mg\nTotal 64500 mg"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Indicates branched chain amino acids (BCAA).\nDenotes naturally occurring and added free form amino acids."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"What is Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power?\nGNC's most advanced protein, Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60, has evolved even further to help meet yous specific training goals and develop more strength and power."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This product is the only whey protein isolate to combine the whey and leucine clinically shown to fuel increased strength and size with additional ingredients proven to amplify power and anabolism. This formula features a protein blend that has been validated in clinical studies to give you a 30% increase in strength, increased muscle size and a 100% improvement in exercise efficiency. Our GNC scientists have AMPed up the protein with a Power Complete featuring an mTOR-stimulating BCAA blend for protein synthesis and added creatine to increase anabolic muscle growth, making this product a combination of 67 products in 1!"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power - break plateaus, build power"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This breakthrough formula takes protein functionality and performance to new levels so you can break through plateaus and achieve a new level of muscular power."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Power complex\nIn addition to 10 gram of leucine, this formula is stracked with 4 grams of both isoleucine and valine to stimulate mTOR activation and give you a powerful boost of all three BCAA to fuel your workouts and enhance your recovery. This product has upped the ante and added a 3 gram creatine blend to boost anabolic factors in the body, increase athletic performance and fuel strength + 600mg of Testofen Fenugreek to help support testosterone levels in the body."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Highly effective whey-leucine base the impressive 60 grams of protein is made entirely from two of the highest quallity, fast-absorbing forms of whey protein, isolates and hydrolysates, including 10 grams of leucine to creatine an ideal environment for muscle protein synthesis. This potent blend delivers arginine, which is involved in creatine synthesis, and over 10 grams of glutamine to provide anabolic effects. In fact, the whey and leucine blend in this product has been shown to increase muscle strength and stamina with half the sets."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Powerful Amino Acid System\nThis product is loaded with arginine and glutamine, two key amino acids necessary for muscle building and recovery. Over 10 grams of glutamine helps to combat catabolism and support muscle function, while arginine helps to support blood vessel tone and blood flow, and is involved in the production of creatine."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Digestive Enzyme Blend for 12% Greater Protein Breakdown\nThis digestive enzyme blend with proven bioactivity is designed to accelerate the availability and absorption of amino acids in muscles. This proprietary enzyme blend provides a 12% greater protein breakdown for improved uptake."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Who can benefit form taking Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power?"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whether you're a serious athlete, weekend warrior or training for a competition, you can benefit from this powerful formula. Now you can customize your dosing to meet your specific training goals and nutrient needs. Boost power and anabolism while improving muscle strength, stamina, size and recovery!"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"When should I take it?\nOnce per day, consume 1-3 scoops of GNC Pro Performance AMP Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power 30 minutes after your workout. On non-training days, consume one serving pre- and post-workout."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Amplified Wheybolic Extreme 60 Power Features 7 products in 1!\n1. Whey protein isolate\n2. Amino acid complex\n3. BCAA complex\n4. Leucine\n5. Creatime \n6. Fenugreek\n7. Digestive enzymes"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Stack with Pro Performance AMP Amplified N.O. Loaded V2 and Strength Vitapak Program."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2017-06-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P025